1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,070
You wake up,

2
00:00:01,070 --> 00:00:02,790
and the glowing numbers are gone.

3
00:00:03,310 --> 00:00:04,590
Your head feels quiet.

4
00:00:05,090 --> 00:00:06,450
Normal, even.

5
00:00:06,450 --> 00:00:08,130
Until you step out of your bedroom,

6
00:00:08,630 --> 00:00:09,530
close the front door,

7
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:11,570
and take two steps down the hallway.

8
00:00:12,670 --> 00:00:13,210
A voice.

9
00:00:13,990 --> 00:00:16,310
Faint, clear, and right in your ear.

10
00:00:17,010 --> 00:00:18,770
Your roommate, talking inside

11
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:20,030
the apartment you just left.

12
00:00:20,650 --> 00:00:21,090
You freeze.

13
00:00:21,810 --> 00:00:23,110
You didn't leave your phone on.

14
00:00:23,230 --> 00:00:24,310
You don't have an earpiece in.

15
00:00:24,950 --> 00:00:26,370
For the next seven days,

16
00:00:26,490 --> 00:00:27,470
whenever you leave a room,

17
00:00:27,470 --> 00:00:30,350
you can hear every single sentence spoken about you.
